// Lumtub skin template — Lumtub 皮肤样板
//
// Copy this folder into your skins folder (Settings › Appearance › Skins ›
// Open skins folder), rename it, change "id" and "name", and save: Lumtub
// reloads the skin every time the file is saved.
// 把这个文件夹复制到你的皮肤文件夹（设置 › 外观 › 皮肤 › 打开皮肤文件夹），
// 改个文件夹名，改掉 "id" 和 "name"，保存即可：每次保存 Lumtub 都会立刻重新载入。
//
// The format is JSON with comments (JSONC): // and /* */ comments and
// trailing commas are fine. skins/skin.schema.json gives editors such as
// VS Code completion and checking; skins/README.md explains every part.
// 格式是带注释的 JSON（JSONC）：可以写 // 和 /* */ 注释，结尾多一个逗号也没关系。
// skins/skin.schema.json 让 VS Code 等编辑器能自动补全和检查；skins/README.md 有完整说明。
//
// Everything is optional except "lumtubSkin", "id", "name" and "brightness".
// Leave a part out and Lumtub draws it its usual way.
// 除了 "lumtubSkin"、"id"、"name"、"brightness"，其余字段都可以不写；
// 不写的部分按 Lumtub 默认的样子画。
//
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// VALUES — 值的写法
//
// colour 颜色:   "#RGB", "#RRGGBB", or "#RRGGBBAA" (alpha last, as in CSS:
//                "#00000080" is half-transparent black), or "transparent".
//                "#RRGGBBAA" 的透明度在最后，和 CSS 一样。
// paint 填充:    a colour, or one of
//                  { "linear":  { "angle": 180, "colors": [..], "stops": [..] } }
//                      angle as in CSS: 180 = top → bottom, 90 = left → right
//                      角度和 CSS 一样：180 从上到下，90 从左到右
//                  { "radial":  { "center": [0.5, 1.1], "radius": 0.6, "colors": [..] } }
//                      center as fractions of the box (may be outside it),
//                      radius as a fraction of its longer side
//                      center 是相对盒子的比例（可以在盒子外），radius 是长边的比例
//                  { "image": "pictures/back.png", "fit": "cover" }
//                      fit: cover, contain, fill, tile; "opacity": 0–1.
//                      Only on window.background. 只能用在 window.background。
//                  { "pattern": { "type": "dots", "color": "#0002", "spacing": 4, "size": 1 } }
//                      type: lines, grid, dots, checker, scanlines, stitch (seams
//                      "spacing" in from top and bottom), grain (wood); "angle" rotates.
//                Where a list of paints is allowed they are painted first to
//                last, so later ones lie on top. 可以写成列表，后面的盖在前面的上面。
// surface 表面:  how a box is drawn (bars, cards, buttons):
//                  {
//                    "fill":   paint or [paints],
//                    "border": "#colour" or { "color": .., "width": 1, "sides": ["bottom"] },
//                    "bevel":  { "light": "#fff", "dark": "#808080", "width": 1,
//                                "innerLight": "#dfdfdf", "innerDark": "#404040" },
//                              — the raised edge of 90s desktops; pressed, it sinks.
//                                90 年代桌面那种立体边，按下时自动变凹。
//                    "radius": 8,          — overrides shape.* for this box 单独指定圆角
//                    "shadow": [{ "color": "#0003", "x": 0, "y": 4, "blur": 12, "spread": 0 }],
//                    "gloss":  0.6,        — 0–1, the white shine of gel buttons 果冻高光
//                    "glow":   "#22e6ff",  — a soft neon light round it 霓虹光晕
//                    "hover":   { ..surface.. },  — while pointed at 鼠标悬停时
//                    "pressed": { ..surface.. },  — while pressed 按下时
//                    "focused": { ..surface.. }   — reached by keyboard or TV remote
//                                                   键盘或电视遥控器移到这里时
//                  }
//                A surface can also be just a paint: "#ffffff".
//                表面也可以只写一个填充，比如 "#ffffff"。
//
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// AVOID THESE — 避坑
//
// 1. Contrast. Lumtub checks every text and icon colour against what it is
//    drawn on: text needs 4.5:1, icons and the accent 3:1. A colour that
//    fails is drawn black or white instead, and Settings lists it. Check
//    pairs, not single colours: colors.text on colors.page, buttonText on
//    button, chipSelectedText on chipSelected, navSelectedText on
//    navSelected, titleBar.text on titleBar.surface, and so on.
//    对比度：Lumtub 会把每个文字、图标颜色和它实际所在的底色配对检查，文字要 4.5:1，
//    图标和强调色要 3:1。不合格的会被换成黑或白，并在设置里列出来。要检查的是「一对」颜色，
//    不是单个颜色。
// 2. Dark skins. Icons vanish when a light, half-transparent surface is
//    laid over a light picture, or when a foreground is left at its
//    default while the background turns dark. Give every surface you add a
//    matching text colour, and keep translucent fills dark in dark skins.
//    深色皮肤：图标看不见，通常是因为半透明的浅色表面叠在浅色图片上，或者背景改深了而前景色还是默认的。
//    每加一个表面就配好它上面的文字颜色；深色皮肤里的半透明填充要保持是深色。
// 3. Eye care (护眼暖色) multiplies everything by a warm tint: blue drops
//    the most, red not at all. Don't tell states apart by blue alone.
//    护眼暖色会给所有颜色乘上暖色：蓝色降得最多，红色不变。别只靠蓝色区分状态。
// 4. Low resource mode leaves out window.decorations. Never put anything
//    the user needs in a decoration.
//    低占用模式会去掉 window.decorations，别把有用的信息只放在装饰里。
// 5. A picture background needs a solid colours.page under it, for while
//    it loads and if the file is missing.
//    用图片当背景时，一定要有一个纯色的 colors.page 兜底（图片加载中或丢失时显示）。
// 6. Pixel and display fonts are for the logo, headings and numbers. Body
//    text stays in the user's font; pixel fonts at 12 px are unreadable,
//    and most have no Chinese.
//    像素字体和装饰字体只用在 logo、标题和数字上；正文保持用户的字体。12 像素的像素字读不清，
//    而且大多没有中文。
// 7. One file for every device. titleBar and menuBar only exist on
//    computers; phones, tablets and TVs ignore them. Use "overrides" for
//    what should differ on a device, and give "focused" looks so TV
//    remotes can see where they are.
//    一份文件全平台通用。titleBar 和 menuBar 只在电脑上有，手机、平板、电视会忽略。
//    要按设备区分就写 "overrides"；记得写 "focused"，电视遥控器才看得出焦点在哪。
//
// Check a skin before sharing it 分享前检查：
//    SKIN=path/to/your/skin flutter test test/skin_check_test.dart
// or look under Settings › Appearance › Skins, which lists every warning.
// 或者在 设置 › 外观 › 皮肤 里看，所有警告都会列出来。
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{
  // Lets editors complete and check this file. 让编辑器自动补全和检查。
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0x696c757a696f/lumtub/main/skins/skin.schema.json",

  // The file format. Always 1 for now. 文件格式版本，目前固定为 1。
  "lumtubSkin": 1,

  // Unique: lower case letters, digits, dots, dashes. A skin of yours with
  // the id of a built-in one replaces it.
  // 唯一标识：小写字母、数字、点、横线。和内置皮肤同 id 时会替换掉内置的那个。
  "id": "my-skin",

  // The name in English, and in other languages by tag.
  // 英文名，以及其他语言的名字（按语言代码）。
  "name": "My Skin",
  "names": { "zh-Hans": "我的皮肤", "zh-Hant": "我的皮膚" },
  "description": "A short line on what it looks like.",
  "descriptions": { "zh-Hans": "一句话介绍它的样子。" },
  "author": "Your name",
  "version": "1.0",
  // So others know what they may do with it. 让别人知道可以怎么使用它。
  "license": "CC0-1.0",

  // light or dark: which way Material widgets without a skin colour lean,
  // and what the system is told for its own dialogs.
  // light 或 dark：没被皮肤指定颜色的控件按哪种走，也会告诉系统用哪种对话框。
  // "auto" follows Lumtub's light/dark mode: the file is the light side and
  // "overrides": { "dark": { .. } } is laid over it in dark mode (see the
  // colour schemes in skins/rice-paper and others).
  // "auto" 跟随浅色/深色模式：文件本身是浅色，深色时叠加 "overrides": { "dark": { .. } }
  //（可以参考 skins/rice-paper 等配色方案）。
  "brightness": "light",

  // Fonts in this folder: family name → file. Use them by family name below.
  // 本文件夹里的字体：字体名 → 文件。下面按字体名使用。
  // Built-in families you can use without a file 无需文件即可使用的内置字体：
  //   "Audiowide", "VT323", "Silkscreen", "Press Start 2P", "Baloo 2", "Exo 2"
  "fonts": {
    // "My Pixel": "fonts/my-pixel.ttf"
  },

  "text": {
    // null keeps the font chosen in Settings (recommended).
    // null 表示用设置里选的字体（推荐）。
    "font": null,
    // Headings and the app name. 标题和 App 名。
    "displayFont": "Baloo 2",
    // Times, durations, the status bar. 时间、时长、状态栏。
    "monoFont": "VT323"
  },

  "colors": {
    // The page where nothing else is drawn; also menus and dialogs.
    // 没有其他东西覆盖时的页面底色，菜单和对话框也用它。
    "page": "#eef6ff",
    "text": "#10233a",
    // Secondary text. 次要文字。
    "muted": "#4a6278",
    // What is chosen, playing or in progress. 选中、正在播放、进行中的颜色。
    "accent": "#0873ad",
    // Text on the accent. 强调色上的文字。
    "onAccent": "#ffffff",
    // Hairlines round fields and panels. 输入框和面板的细边框。
    "border": "#b9d4ea",
    // Fields, menus and placeholders. 输入框、菜单、占位块。
    "card": "#ffffff",
    // A chosen list row, and its text. 选中的列表行和上面的文字。
    "selected": "#d8eeff",
    "onSelected": "#10233a",
    // The line under a recommended video saying why. 推荐理由那行字。
    "reason": "#0873ad",
    // Top bar and side rail, when window.topBar / sideBar are not given.
    // 没写 window.topBar / sideBar 时，顶栏和侧栏的底色。
    "chrome": "#e3f0fa",
    // 0–0.3: how much of the accent fields and menus take on.
    // 0–0.3：输入框和菜单带多少强调色。
    "tint": 0,
    // Borders and secondary text as strong as can be (high contrast).
    // 边框和次要文字加到最强（高对比）。
    "strong": false
  },

  "shape": {
    // Cards, panels, menus, dialogs. 卡片、面板、菜单、对话框。
    "cardRadius": 14,
    // Buttons, fields, chips, list rows; 99 makes pills. 按钮、输入框、标签；99 就是胶囊形。
    "controlRadius": 99,
    "thumbnailRadius": 10
  },

  "window": {
    // Painted bottom first, behind everything. 从下往上画，在所有内容后面。
    "background": [
      { "linear": { "angle": 180, "colors": ["#cdeaff", "#f6fbff"] } },
      { "radial": { "center": [0.9, 0.0], "radius": 0.5, "colors": ["#ffffffcc", "#ffffff00"] } }
    ],

    // Ornaments over the background, under the content. Left out in low
    // resource mode. "above": true draws one over the content too.
    // 背景之上、内容之下的装饰；低占用模式下不画。"above": true 会画在内容上面。
    // type: bubbles, sparkles, perspectiveGrid, beam, waves, pattern
    "decorations": [
      { "type": "bubbles", "count": 6, "color": "#78dcff59" },
      { "type": "sparkles", "count": 4, "color": "#ffffff", "glow": "#7fd0ff" }
      // { "type": "pattern", "pattern": "scanlines", "color": "#0000000f", "spacing": 3, "above": true }
    ],

    // The title bar drawn by Lumtub instead of the system's, on computers
    // only. Minimise, maximise and close sit at the right, unless
    // "placement": "left" puts close, minimise, maximise at the left. Users
    // can switch back to the system title bar in Settings.
    // 由 Lumtub 自己画的标题栏（只在电脑上）。最小化、最大化、关闭默认在右边；
    // "placement": "left" 时改为左边，依次是关闭、最小化、最大化。用户可以在设置里换回系统标题栏。
    "titleBar": {
      "enabled": true,
      "height": 30,
      "surface": { "fill": { "linear": { "angle": 180, "colors": ["#ffffff", "#d6ecfb"] } }, "border": { "color": "#9fc9e6", "sides": ["bottom"] } },
      // While the window is in the background. 窗口不在前台时。
      "inactive": { "fill": "#e8f1f8" },
      "text": "#10233a",
      // left or center 标题靠左或居中
      "align": "left",
      "icon": true,
      "buttons": {
        "size": [40, 26],
        "icon": "#10233a",
        "surface": { "fill": "transparent", "hover": { "fill": "#0000001a" }, "pressed": { "fill": "#00000033" } },
        "close": { "fill": "transparent", "hover": { "fill": "#e81123" }, "pressed": { "fill": "#a50e1a" } },
        // "minimize" and "maximize" give those two a look of their own;
        // "glyphs": "hover" shows the signs only under the pointer.
        // "minimize"、"maximize" 可以单独设样子；"glyphs": "hover" 鼠标移上去才显示符号。
        "placement": "right"
      }
    },

    // Text menus (File, View, Play, Help) under the title bar, drawn by
    // Lumtub, on computers only. Alt and the underlined letter open a menu.
    // 标题栏下面的文字菜单（文件、查看、播放、帮助），由 Lumtub 画，只在电脑上。
    // 按 Alt 加带下划线的字母打开菜单。
    "menuBar": {
      "enabled": false,
      "surface": "#f4f9fd",
      "text": "#10233a",
      "highlight": "#0873ad",
      "highlightText": "#ffffff",
      "menu": { "fill": "#ffffff", "border": "#9fc9e6" },
      "underlineKeys": true,
      // A clock at the right end. 右端显示时钟。
      "clock": false,
      // "top" puts the menus above the title bar, along the top of the
      // window; its empty part then moves the window too. "appMenu": true
      // adds a first menu named after the app in bold (About, Settings,
      // Quit). Without "surface" both bars take colors.chrome.
      // "top" 把菜单放到标题栏上面、窗口最顶上，空白处也能拖动窗口。"appMenu": true
      // 会在最前面加一个粗体的应用菜单（关于、设置、退出）。不写 "surface" 时两条栏都用 colors.chrome。
      "position": "title",
      "appMenu": false,
      "height": 26
    },

    // The bar with the logo and search box. 有 logo 和搜索框的那一栏。
    "topBar": { "fill": "#ffffffb3", "border": { "color": "#b9d4ea", "sides": ["bottom"] } },
    // The page list at the left. 左边的页面列表。
    "sideBar": { "fill": "#ffffff73", "border": { "color": "#ffffff", "sides": ["right"] } },
    "statusBar": { "fill": "#ffffffb3", "border": { "color": "#b9d4ea", "sides": ["top"] } },
    // The pages as tabs on a phone or in a narrow window, in place of the
    // side rail; leave it out for Lumtub's own bottom bar. "position":
    // "bottom" or "top" (under the top bar). "selected" is what the page
    // shown sits on, "indicator" a line under it (over it at the bottom).
    // "labels": "text" leaves out the icons; "caps" writes the words in
    // capitals.
    // 手机或窄窗口里代替侧栏的页面标签栏；不写就用 Lumtub 自己的底部栏。"position"：
    // "bottom" 在底部，"top" 在顶栏下面。"selected" 是当前页下面的底，"indicator" 是
    // 当前页的指示线（在底部时画在上沿）。"labels": "text" 不要图标，"caps" 文字大写。
    "tabs": {
      "position": "bottom",
      "surface": { "fill": "#ffffffcc", "border": { "color": "#b9d4ea", "sides": ["top"] } },
      "selected": { "fill": "#cfe6fb", "radius": 6 },
      "text": "#4a6278",
      "selectedText": "#0b4f8a",
      "labels": "below",
      "caps": false,
      "height": 56
    },
    // Icons on the top bar and the status line's text; give them when the
    // bars are much darker or lighter than the page.
    // 顶栏图标和状态栏文字的颜色；顶栏、状态栏比页面深很多或浅很多时一定要写。
    "topBarText": "#10233a",
    "statusBarText": "#4a6278"
  },

  "controls": {
    // What a click looks like: wash (the control darkens at once), ripple
    // (a ring spreads from the pointer) or glow (an accent-coloured wash).
    // 点击效果：wash 整块变暗、ripple 水波纹、glow 发光。
    "press": "wash",
    // Ordinary buttons. 普通按钮。
    "button": { "fill": { "linear": { "angle": 180, "colors": ["#ffffff", "#ddeefa"] } }, "border": "#9fc9e6", "hover": { "fill": "#ffffff" } },
    "buttonText": "#10233a",
    // The main button of a dialog or page. 对话框或页面里的主按钮。
    "primaryButton": { "fill": { "linear": { "angle": 180, "colors": ["#1775b5", "#06548a"] } }, "gloss": 0.6, "border": "#1a6fa8" },
    "primaryButtonText": "#ffffff",
    // Filter tags such as on the explore page. 探索页那种筛选标签。
    "chip": { "fill": "#ffffff", "border": "#b9d4ea" },
    "chipSelected": { "fill": "#0873ad" },
    "chipSelectedText": "#ffffff",
    // The chosen page in the side bar, and the others' text.
    // 侧栏里选中的页面，以及其他项的文字颜色。
    "navSelected": { "fill": "#ffffff", "shadow": [{ "color": "#1e8cc84d", "y": 2, "blur": 8 }] },
    "navSelectedText": "#0873ad",
    "navText": "#4a6278"
  },

  "cards": {
    // What video cards sit on. Leave out for a picture and text on the page.
    // 视频卡片的底。不写就是图片加文字直接放在页面上。
    "video": { "fill": "#ffffff99", "border": "#ffffff", "focused": { "border": { "color": "#0873ad", "width": 2 } } },
    "padding": 8,
    // Dialogs, menus, panels on the watch page. 对话框、菜单、播放页的面板。
    "panel": { "fill": "#ffffffcc", "border": "#ffffff" },
    // The length label on a thumbnail, and its text. 缩略图上的时长标签和文字。
    "durationBadge": { "fill": "#10233acc" },
    "durationText": "#ffffff"
  },

  // Icons. "style": "fill" draws every icon filled; "effect" gives them a
  // skeuomorphic finish: emboss (raised), engrave (pressed in), gel (shine
  // and shadow) or glow ("glow": colour, the accent when left out). Effects
  // are left out in Low resource mode.
  // 图标。"style": "fill" 让所有图标用实心；"effect" 加拟物效果：emboss 浮雕、engrave 凹刻、
  // gel 凝胶（高光加阴影）、glow 发光（"glow" 写颜色，不写就用强调色）。低占用模式下不画效果。
  "icons": { "style": "regular", "effect": "none" },

  "logo": {
    // Leave out for "Lumtub". 不写就显示 "Lumtub"。
    "text": "LUMTUB",
    "font": "Baloo 2",
    "size": 24,
    "fill": { "linear": { "angle": 180, "colors": ["#bff0ff", "#0874b8"] } },
    "stroke": null,
    "shadow": "#ffffff",
    "glow": null,
    "badge": { "fill": { "radial": { "center": [0.5, 0.75], "radius": 0.7, "colors": ["#a8ff7a", "#13782c"] } }, "gloss": 0.8 },
    "badgeIcon": "#ffffff"
  },

  "player": {
    // default, or lcd: a display with the time, scrolling title and a
    // spectrum under the picture, as on late-90s media players.
    // default 或 lcd：画面下方加一块显示屏，显示时间、滚动标题和频谱，像 90 年代末的播放器。
    "style": "default",
    // The played part of the progress bar. 进度条已播放的部分。
    "progress": { "linear": { "angle": 90, "colors": ["#19b8ff", "#8df27a"] } }
    // With "style": "lcd" 用 lcd 样式时还可以写：
    // "frame":    { ..surface.. },  — round the picture 画面外框
    // "lcd":      { ..surface.. },  — the display 显示屏
    // "lcdText":  "#7dff5a", "lcdAccent": "#ffb02e", "spectrum": true,
    // "lcdFont":  "VT323"            — the display's font 显示屏字体
  },

  // What should differ on a kind of device: desktop, mobile, tablet, tv.
  // Laid over the rest of the file, field by field.
  // 按设备区分的设置：desktop、mobile、tablet、tv。会逐个字段覆盖上面的设置。
  // With "brightness": "auto", "light" and "dark" work the same way.
  // "brightness" 为 "auto" 时，"light" 和 "dark" 也这样用。
  "overrides": {
    "tv": {
      "shape": { "cardRadius": 20 },
      "cards": { "video": { "focused": { "border": { "color": "#0873ad", "width": 4 }, "glow": "#0873ad" } } }
    }
  }
}
